 "arm_in_words": "NOT the deployed route. IB-pr-467's arm, unchanged: the route reader's own code at the base commit (holdings_gold.calculate, with the source the route composes at installed.py:75 for each of its two firms) run locally over the SERVED holdings gold read from S3 (list and get only; no Lambda invoked, no sign-in, nothing written to AWS). Every partition at or before 2026-10-08 was read once into a local cache outside the worktree; the reader's calculate() was run once per account per window with the rows served from memory by IB-pr-464's stand-in for the source's transport (copied). The status census, the day placement and the claim counter are this driver's, over the same cached rows.",
